  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka abulila ŋadi kuyitudika kudi Chinaweji? Ninawa amwiluka abulila ŋadi kumona mafuku indi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi awa atutululaŋa ŋinza; abuwaŋa nyikanka yanyikoku, hiyakuyidiisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutwala chimbulu chanshona, hiyakukwata ŋombi yantuluwa yiikali kapopu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakufumisha abula yuma munjila; atuzweŋi ahamaseki hiyakubatama hamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu, ayaŋa kunyidimu yawu nakukeŋakeŋa nankashi tunyama twawu twanyikoka, neyi ayimbulu amwisaŋa; hiyakumona yakudya yawanyanawu muchana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwaŋula kudya kwawu kwansaachi mumaha; hiyakunonojola nyikabu yavinyu yawantu atama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wufuku wejima akamaŋa nzekesi chakadi chakuvwala, hiyakweti chakudibuta nachishikaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azowaŋa nanvula jakumapidi jawo-wo-wo, akumbataŋa ilola nanochu chabulaŋawu kwakweyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahukulaŋa nshona kwiyeli, atambulaŋa kapopu kudi kazweŋi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwaka akimbukaŋa nawuvu chakadi yakuvwala, mwaka asendaŋa yita nanzala yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋaŋa manji muyipaŋu yawenawa, hela ayidatilaŋa vinyu muwukamwinu wawu wavinyu, saŋa atiyilawu mpwila hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyikala mwasweja luntu mwatiyakanaŋa kwaba kwabaŋawu antu, nyichima yawantu anakatishuwu yakalokaŋa nyiteti; hela chochu, Nzambi hayilaŋa nindi mwasupaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu akweti adikaŋaŋa nachejeji; hiyeluka njila jachuku, hiyashakamaŋa munjila jachuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbanji wahindukaŋa chikukwila to-o, hakujaha kazweŋi nawabula yuma; nawufuku wudi neyi ikombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu achivumbi achiŋililaŋa kabwidibwidi, nindi, Kwosi disu dikunmonaku, hakudibuta ni kumesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diwu apundaŋa matala awakwawu namwidima; adipatilaŋamu namwa ana; hiyeluka mwaanaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wejima wawu amonaŋa budidi neyi himwevulu wakufwa; muloŋa mutentu wamwevulu wakufwa awiluka dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waleluka hewulu dameji; iseka dawu dashiŋewa hanu hamaseki; hahitilaŋa njila yamatempa anyivinyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaaŋa nankanza anoŋeshaŋa meji anvula yachishika yitooka; dichi chelaŋa kaluŋa nawantu anavulumuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivumu damuvwala dakamuvulamena, mavunu akamudya akamutiya kutowala; hiyamba kamwanuka nawa cheŋuku; kuheŋa kwakakotoka neyi chikwamutondu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadyaŋa nshinta wakasemaŋa; hela ntuluwa hamwilaŋa yayiwahuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwaŋovu wayikokelaŋa kwacheŋi naŋovu jindi; chakunyamukayi niniwu wukwila nindi nukuhanda, kwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi nayishakamishi mwa zo-o, hiyakunookelamu, ilaŋa mesu indi adi kunjila jawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anayinyamuni hewulu; hela chochu, chakadi nikuleha hikwosi; mwalala ayikunkumwisha dehi mwishina, ayifumisha dehi munjila neyi akwawu ejima, ayiketulamu dehi ngwa neyi nyitu yansaachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi hidimu chayaku wukuntwambisha hinyi? Wukusekesha munahoshi hinyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
